  "design_notes": [
    "global external Application Load Balancer has separate backend services for the instance-group and serverless NEG backends",
    "URL map selects one default backend at a time",
    "Cloud SQL is outside the customer VPC and reached through Direct VPC egress and Private Services Access",
    "migration diagram distinguishes baseline write-freeze from gated DMS continuous migration",
    "routes use orthogonal connectors and preserve GCP scope boundaries",
    "the source VM has no external IP; Cloud NAT is scoped to the source subnet for outbound bootstrap only"
